RESPONSIBLE USE NOTICE (not legally binding, but important):

This software is designed for deployment on infrastructure you own and control.
It is a defensive security tool in the same category as fail2ban, mod_security,
and commercial WAF products. Use it that way.

Do not deploy against systems you do not own or have permission to monitor.
Do not use it to target individuals outside your own user base.
See docs/ETHICS.md for the full design rationale.
